= Later becomes a policy

The prime minister's staff ask Lewica to stop opening new social files until
judicial repair, EU milestones and fiscal rules are secure. Coalition managers
call this sequencing. Labour and movement organisers call it government by
permanent postponement.

- @social_floor_now
- @social_labor_deadline
- @social_wait

