= Homes or balance sheets

KO proposes buyer credit and faster private construction. PSL asks for local
discretion and relief outside the largest cities. Tenant groups answer that
subsidised demand can raise prices while eviction rules, deposits and the
public rental stock remain untouched.

- @tenant_full
- @tenant_first
- @tenant_subsidy

